# Coast road: enter with Right twice (colour cycle -> parallax -> coast
# road). Init keeps the display off for about 21 frames while it builds
# the planes. Then drive the track at full speed through the long
# right-hander and into the hard left, and exercise reverse and pause.
run 20
press right
run 20
press right
run 40
shot road-start            65991885 # straight road, sun, sea, palms
# C twice (released in between): half a phase per frame -> a full phase
press c
run 2
press c
run 250
shot road-right            9d66a1c3 # full right-hander; background slid left
run 430
shot road-left             4eb456c3 # hard left; background slid back right
press b
run 120
shot road-reverse          38248814 # B: backing out of the left-hander
run 10
press start
run 30
shot paused-a              392453b0 # Start: paused...
run 60
shot paused-b              392453b0 # ...so this frame must match paused-a
press start
run 30
shot resumed               cad3044e # still reversing, nearly straight
